      "number": 1,
      "title": "Search results drop the last page when a repository filter is active",
      "body": "Filtering by repository and paging to the end loses the final page. The cursor advances past the last row before the filter is applied, so the tail is never returned.\n\nSteps: open Saved Views, apply a repository filter, page to the end.",
